---
layout: layout.njk
title: "Projects"
description: "Projects by Sarah Mitchell - Web Developer Portfolio"
---

<section data-pagefind-body>
  <h1>My Projects</h1>
  <p>Below are some of the <strong>projects</strong> I've worked on. Each project demonstrates different <em>skills</em> and technologies.</p>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Project Gallery</h2>
  <div class="project-grid">
    {% for project in collections.projects %}
    <article>
      <h3>{{ project.data.title }}</h3>
      <p>{{ project.data.description }}</p>
      <p><em>Built with: {{ project.data.technologies | join(", ") }}</em></p>
      <ul>
        {% for feature in project.data.features %}
        <li>{{ feature }}</li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
      <a href="{{ project.url }}">Read Case Study →</a>
    </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>